# 🛡️ Showcase-Only Gitignore
# This ensures only documentation is tracked. 
# YOUR TRADING LOGIC REMAINS LOCAL.

# 1. Ignore everything by default
*

# 2. Allow the Documentation folder and README
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**
!config_template.json
!.gitignore

# 3. Explicitly block sensitive files (Double-check)
.env
config.json
logs/
dist/
build/
*.py
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.pyarmor/
ICT_Scalper_Client/